		 Issue Pos: 11
		 Consequence: needAllow(agent=fath
		 RuleName: r2
		 Num Of Counter: 1
		0 :  *  !  >:0!:0<:0 -needAllow(agent=fat

			[ 子一覧表示の例 ]
	
		Arg ID:
			親論証ID。nillは親論証がないか、親論証IDがない場合。
		Issue Pos:
